# DevThink runtime and release data
.devthink/
release/
*.local.json
auth.json
identity.json
pairings.json
devthink.sqlite
devthink.sqlite-*
docs/git.history.tgz
web/dist/
web/.manus-logs/
/home/ubuntu/shyz-audit/
docs-file-manifest.txt
docs-dir-manifest.txt

# Provider runtime artifacts (the antigravity engine's local state: the .antigravity cache, the opencode pairing record, the account store and the oauth logs never enter the repository)
.antigravity
opencode.json
antigravity-accounts.json
antigravity-logs

# Generated build output stays out of the repository (the runners generate everything): the flat staged npm package of tests/build.mjs never commits
distpackage/

# the prisma test databases are runtime artifacts the test runs create
web/prisma/*.db
web/prisma/*.db-journal
# the generated capacitor shells of the mobile lane (runner-side toolchain output, never committed)
web/android/
web/ios/
web/capacitor.config.json

# the runner residue of the release ladder and the publish lanes (the maven target with the jar and the dist bundle copies, the nuget obj and validation output, the native smoke profile, the publish staging dirs) never enters the repository — the biome gate reads the ignore file and lints the product tree, not the workspace scratch
target/
obj/
validation/
smokeprofile/
mavenrelease/
nuget/

# the runner-side workspace of the release and publish lanes (the mobile wrappers staging, the security evidence, the release assets staging, the native desktop scaffold, the per-application generated icon assets) never enters the repository — build/ is toolchain output, the workflows generate everything and the folder stays hidden from the tree
build/
*/build/

# agent campaign scratch never enters the repository (user rule)
design-campaign*.md
worklog.md
tool-results/
upload/

temp/
sites/

# the scaffold skills folder never enters the repository (user rule)
skills/

# The mini-services folder never enters the repository — the local service
# doors (the github device flow) live outside the tree, untracked
mini-services/

# The synchronized database folder never enters the repository — the db/
# folder carries the live sqlite partitions the platform syncs between
# environments (custom.db with its -shm and -wal sidecars): committing it
# corrupts the runtime state and breaks the workflow gates, so the whole
# folder stays untracked the way devthink.sqlite does
db/
db/*.db
db/*.db-shm
db/*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# the docs audit scratch (tests/docsaudit.mjs writes beside the repo root)
/shyz-audit/

# the polar lane stays machine-local — polar.sh polls the github device flow
# in the background (the four charged realtime failures answer here), the
# auth.status file flips on every poll tick so tracking it would dirty the
# tree forever, and the .github-token file is a credential: the secret law
# forbids it from ever riding a commit
polar.sh
auth.status
.github-token

# the study lane stays machine-local — the official site mirror, the allan
# corpus copies, the neo.img logo references and the neo.temp catalog pulls
# are sandbox study material of the reading waves; the two-repos law keeps
# them out of the family code repository (allan already archives the sources)
allan-md/
neo-img/
neo-temp-ref/
official-mirror/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FAMILY APPLICATION CONTRACTS (consolidated from the eleven per-app
# .gitignore files — the repository root is the only official ignore surface
# and the application folders carry no ignore files of their own)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Family-wide application outputs (the shared contract of all eleven apps,
# ported from the identical block every app folder carried; verified: no
# tracked file anywhere in the repository matches these names — the tracked
# .dev.vars.example faces never match the exact .dev.vars name):
# releasecheck/  the npm-pack verification scratch the CI release gates create
# .dev.vars      the wrangler secret vars of the cloudflare lane
# *.db / *.db-journal  the runtime sqlite stores of the local app databases
# android/ ios/ capacitor.config.json  the generated capacitor shells of the
#                mobile lane (npx cap add / cap sync materializes them beside
#                the app; the tracked capacitor.config.ts stays the source)
releasecheck/
.dev.vars
*.db
*.db-journal
android/
ios/
capacitor.config.json

# The flat vite emit of the family apps (every app builds with outDir ".":
# the content-hashed bundles land at the application root and the pages
# workflow regenerates them at every deploy, so only the canonical unhashed
# faces stay tracked). devthink deliberately tracks icon-192.png and
# icon-512.png, so the devthink lane carries none of the icon patterns.
argan/index-*.js
argan/index-*.css
argan/index-*.wasm
argan/favicon-*.svg
argan/favicon-*.png
argan/favicon-*.ico
argan/manifest-*.webmanifest
argan/icon-*.png
argan/apple-touch-icon*.png
argan/*.woff2
cadria/index-*.js
cadria/index-*.css
cadria/index-*.wasm
cadria/favicon-*.svg
cadria/favicon-*.png
cadria/favicon-*.ico
cadria/manifest-*.webmanifest
cadria/icon-*.png
cadria/apple-touch-icon*.png
cadria/*.woff2
cobaia/index-*.js
cobaia/index-*.css
cobaia/favicon-*.svg
cobaia/icon-*.svg
cobaia/manifest-*.webmanifest
cobaia/*.woff2
debonair/index-*.js
debonair/index-*.css
debonair/favicon-*.svg
debonair/favicon-*.png
debonair/favicon-*.ico
debonair/manifest-*.webmanifest
debonair/icon-*.png
debonair/apple-touch-icon*.png
debonair/registerSW-*.js
debonair/sw.js
debonair/*.woff2
devthink/index-*.js
devthink/index-*.css
